CONCLUSION: 'bit-exact instruction count is structurally unavailable under an OS' is FALSE.
It is a property of the WORKLOAD (single-threaded, arena, data-independent control flow),
not of the absence of an OS. Measured here in a VM, under load, non-root, in ~20 minutes.
